  "description": "<p>With the new fcrepo-camel-ldpath service, some of the fields sent to Solr have changed. </p>\n\n<p>Because this is vagrant, I suggest adding a catch all dynamic text field. This will create a field for any value field name submitted.</p>\n\n<p>So not great for production, but better for development and testing.</p>",
